//   * OhioMeansJobs moved from Community & Social to Business & Economy.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Logan County WV/KY/IL/CO/KS/OK/AR/ND/NE; Logan, Ohio is Hocking County's seat;
//   Bellefontaine Neighbors MO; Huntsville AL/TX; Quincy IL/MA; West Liberty KY/IA/WV;
//   Ohio Caverns is in Champaign County; the county site's "Humane Society" link goes
//   to Union County's; Mary Rutan's locations page carries a Nebraska template name.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Bellefontaine, the seat). Villages with sites include Belle Center,
//     De Graff, Huntsville, Lakeview, Quincy, Rushsylvania, Russells Point, West
//     Liberty and West Mansfield; Ridgeway is filed under Hardin County.
//   * Five school districts (Bellefontaine City, Benjamin Logan, Indian Lake,
//     Riverside, West Liberty-Salem), Ohio Hi-Point Career Center and Clark State's
//     Bellefontaine location.
//   * Mary Rutan Hospital; Community Health & Wellness Partners (FQHC); the
//     Logan-Champaign mental health board (MHDAS, West Liberty).
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * loganvets.com (dead; the county Veterans page is listed), Ohio Caverns
//     (Champaign, private) and Mad River Mountain (private resort).
//   * Valley Hi and Zanesfield, ten townships, several fire departments, the land
//     bank and a park district: no site found.

